flowchart LR
  rom["External combinational instruction ROM"] -->|instruction: 32 bits| core["processor_step: combinational next-state logic"]
  regs["State registers: 122 bits"] -->|current state| core
  core -->|next state| regs
  clock["clk"] --> regs
  reset["synchronous reset: clears state"] --> regs
  regs -->|pc: 8 bits| rom
  regs -->|values and enables: 8 bits each| pads["protocol_pads: logical tri-state adapter"]
  pads <-->|8 pads| peer["External IO cells and protocol peer"]
  pads --> sync["External input synchronization"]
  sync -->|inputs: 8 bits| core
  regs --> status["pc, wait_remaining, pins, halted, fault, scratch, count, enables"]
  %% ROM, physical IO cells, synchronization and protocol peers are integrator-owned.
  %% The generated implementation.v includes processor_step, protocol_processor and protocol_pads.
